// HOLDOUT ARENA precache.                              [user 2026-08-05] bug-1393
// The engine execs maps/<mapname>_precache.scr, so a renamed map silently gets NO precache at all -
// every model, sound and effect then loads on first use instead of up front. Reuse e3l4's list
// verbatim; the arena runs on a copy of that geometry, so it needs exactly the same assets.
exec maps/e3l4_precache.scr
